# Purpose

This document records the official Architecture Consistency Audit performed prior to the Architecture Release 1.0 of the Hellenic American Pool History Platform.

The audit verifies the consistency, completeness and traceability of the approved Specification Library.

# Scope

The audit includes:

- Governance Documents
- Specification Library
- Core Entity Specifications
- Relationship Entity Specifications
- Value Object Specifications

Implementation artifacts are outside the scope of this audit.

