# Audit Criteria

The Architecture Audit verified:

- Metadata consistency
- Specification structure consistency
- Domain consistency
- Aggregate boundaries
- Business Rules
- Domain Invariants
- Value Object usage
- Cross-document references
- Governance compliance
- Traceability

