|------|--------|
| Governance | PASS |
| Specification Library | PASS |
| Core Entities | PASS |
| Relationship Entities | PASS |
| Value Objects | PASS |
| Traceability | PASS |
| Governance Compliance | PASS |

# Findings

The audit identified only minor documentation improvements.

All identified improvements have been recorded in GOV-010 – Architecture Improvement Log for future releases.

No architectural inconsistencies preventing Release 1.0 were identified.

# Overall Assessment

The Domain Model is internally consistent.

The Specification Library is complete for Architecture Release 1.0.

Governance procedures have been successfully applied throughout the Specification Library.

The Architecture is considered stable and suitable as the baseline for implementation.

# Release Recommendation

Architecture Release 1.0

Recommendation:

APPROVED

